.TH ORO-IPC-ROUTES 7 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime Guides"
.SH NAME
oro\-ipc\-routes \- generated catalog of resolved IPC routes
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
This guide indexes 375 resolved IPC routes across 43 top\-level domains.
.PP
Each route entry lists the transport families used from JavaScript, the public oro:* APIs that expose it, and the source locations that define or consume it.
.SH HOW TO READ THIS CATALOG
.IP \(bu 2
Transports show which oro:ipc primitive is used at the call site.
.IP \(bu 2
Modules list the oro:* entry points that surface the route.
.IP \(bu 2
Exposed by points at the nearest documented API function or method plus the source line where the route is invoked.
.IP \(bu 2
Binary semantics flags routes that carry raw request or response bytes rather than plain JSON\-like payloads.
.SH ROUTES
.PP
This catalog is generated from JavaScript calls to ipc.request(), ipc.send(), ipc.sendSync(), ipc.write(), and thin wrappers around those primitives. It inventories 375 resolved routes across 43 top\-level domains.
.PP
1 IPC call sites still use route expressions that could not be reduced to static strings. Review those locations before treating this catalog as complete for private dynamic dispatch.
.IP \(bu 2
send oro:internal/init RuntimeWorker.constructor() (api/internal/init.js#L576)
.PP
